colorcpp (1.0.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Align packaging version with upstream 1.0.8 (was 0.3.0).
  * Use GNUInstallDirs and ARCH_INDEPENDENT CMake package version.
  * Enable -Wconversion; fix size_t->float conversions in palette/random.
  * CI: minimum GCC 11 / Clang 14 job, C++20 on macOS and Windows.
  * Documentation corrections (README examples, CSS hex, compiler matrix).
  * Add Helland Kelvin reference vectors and achromatic polar lerp tests.

